{
    "title": "Dino Coloring Game",
    "description": "Free dinosaur coloring book game. This coloring page game is fun to use and offers lots of free coloring pages. Color the coloring pages of dinos and share them with family or friends.\r\n\r\n- Fun to play\r\n- Share your drawing\r\n- Save and load your coloring pages\r\n- Create your own painting\r\n- Many different colors\r\n- Print your dino\r\n\r\nThis is a perfect game for stimulating the creativity both for adults and for kids. If you love dinos and like to coloring, this game is great.\r\n\r\nSo go on a historic jurassic safari with us now. For everyone who like a dinosaur adventure we have lots of dino designs to choose from.  \r\n\r\n- Raptors like tyrannosaurus rex\r\n- Friendly herbivores\r\n- Mother and kid dinosaurs.\r\n- Fossils\r\n- Dino from the egg\r\n- Bird dinosaur.\r\n\r\nFree app for all dino fans with 200+ coloring pages of dinosaurs.  Lots of designs with friendly herbivores, lovely mother dinos with their kids and fierce dino king like T Rex.\r\n\r\nHave fun!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Free dinosaur coloring book game. This coloring page game is fun to use and offers lots of free coloring pages. Color the coloring pages of dinos and share them with family or friends.<br><br>- Fun to play<br>- Share your drawing<br>- Save and load your coloring pages<br>- Create your own painting<br>- Many different colors<br>- Print your dino<br><br>This is a perfect game for stimulating the creativity both for adults and for kids. If you love dinos and like to coloring, this game is great.<br><br>So go on a historic jurassic safari with us now. For everyone who like a dinosaur adventure we have lots of dino designs to choose from.  <br><br>- Raptors like tyrannosaurus rex<br>- Friendly herbivores<br>- Mother and kid dinosaurs.<br>- Fossils<br>- Dino from the egg<br>- Bird dinosaur.<br><br>Free app for all dino fans with 200+ coloring pages of dinosaurs.  Lots of designs with friendly herbivores, lovely mother dinos with their kids and fierce dino king like T Rex.<br><br>Have fun!",
